Chapter: Display

 The Display effect provides draw-text, draw-rect, clear, and set-pixel.
 To draw-text renders text at the given x and y coordinates.
 To draw-rect draws a rectangle at the given position with the given width and height.
 To clear erases the entire display.
 To set-pixel sets a single pixel at the given x, y, and color value.

 We say:

Section: Definitions

  effect Display where
    draw-text  : Text, Integer, Integer -> [Display] Nothing
    draw-rect  : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> [Display] Nothing
    clear      : [Display] Nothing
    set-pixel  : Integer, Integer, Integer -> [Display] Nothing

